        "content": "Polls one durable intake/retry job each minute. Claims with SKIP LOCKED and lease token. A stale worker cannot checkpoint. Research currently invokes matching; both must be verified live before publication. Proposal jobs require a separate export branch.\nProposal jobs call 06_proposal_generation; replace its placeholder ID after import. The proposal sub-workflow finalizes its own bundle and job in one database transaction.\nResearch and matching are separate checkpoints. Retry resumes from researched or matched lead state.",
